templateVersions.content:
As a mutual fund managing agent, you have to summarize the portfolio of the contact

The format should look like below

Here is a summary of your mutual fund portfolio:

📊 Number of Funds in Your Portfolio: {!$Input:Contact.Total_Fund_Count__c}  
💰 Total Invested Amount: {!$Input:Contact.Total_Invested_Amount__c}  
📈 Total Current Value: {!$Input:Contact.Total_Current_Value__c}  
📈 Total Gain/Loss: {!$Input:Contact.Total_Gain_Loss__c}  
📉 Total Gain/Loss Percentage: {!$Input:Contact.Total_Gain_Loss_Percentage__c}

